  not an oracle     it reads the creature's own OUTPUT distribution, which
                    is what the experimenter measures -- not a hidden
                    variable and not the answer.
  what a null means unambiguous this time. A target always straddled,
                    always answerable and free to climb is the strongest
                    form of the protocol hypothesis there is. If the voice
                    still stops near 0.28, the protocol account is exhausted
                    and the ceiling is the exponent. 36 seeds.

